  "designMd": {
    "raw": "# Mac2MQTT — Design System\n\nNative macOS menu-bar bridge. 820 × 660 window, light + dark.\n\n## 1. Foundations\n\n**Window** 820 × 660, corner radius 28, drop shadow `rgba(0,0,0,0.16)` y20 blur40 (dark: 0.45).\n**Grid** 196px sidebar + 16px gutter + 572px content column. Content padding: 50px top, 16px bottom.\n**Spacing** 2 / 4 / 6 / 8 / 10 / 12 / 14 / 16 — cards use 16, groups 12–14, list rows 13, tiles 14.\n**Radius scale** 4 artwork · 7 badge & input · 9 icon badge · 10 control & nav item · 14 tile, list, pill button · 15 circle · 16 card · 20 panel & app icon · 28 window.\n\n## 2. Typography\n\nInter for UI, Menlo for topics and other literals. Line height 1.1 for headings, 1.2 for body, 1.4 for prose.\n\n| Size | Weight | Use |\n|---|---|---|\n| 24 | 700 | hero app name (About) |\n| 20 | 700 | page title |\n| 16 | 600 | tile value |\n| 14 | 600 | card headline, track title |\n| 13 | 600 | metric value |\n| 12 | 600 | section label, nav label, row title, button label |\n| 11 | 400–600 | secondary text, tile label, badge label |\n| 10 | 400–600 | caption, entity count, hint, topic value |\n\nWeights: 400 body · 500 row title · 600 label & emphasis · 700 page title. Nothing below 10px; body copy never below 11px.\n\n## 3. Color\n\nEvery color is a document variable. Light and dark share the same role names with a `/light` or `/dark` suffix. Raw hex is allowed only for OS chrome (traffic lights), the artwork gradient, and the sidebar glass overlays.\n\n**Surfaces** `surface` (cards, rows) · `surface/control` (inputs, neutral buttons) · `surface/badge` (neutral badge) · `canvas` + `canvas/tint` (window gradient).\n**Text** `text/primary` · `text/secondary` · `text/tertiary` (counts and hints).\n**Accent** `accent` (primary button, progress, switch on) · `accent/text` (links) · `accent/soft` + `accent/icon` (blue badges) · `accent/selected` + `accent/selected-border` (selected nav item).\n**Status** `success` · `success/text` · `success/soft` · `warning` + `warning/soft` · `danger` + `danger/soft` · `accent/pink` + `accent/pink-soft` · `violet` + `violet/soft` · `cyan` + `cyan/soft` · `neutral/icon`.\n**Ink & lines** `border` · `ink` · `on-accent` · `on-brand` · `on-media` · `brand`.\n\nContrast: body and label text ≥ 4.5:1 against its surface in both modes; `text/secondary` on `surface` is 5.9:1 (light) and 6.4:1 (dark).\n\n## 4. Components\n\n- **Sidebar** — 196px, radius 20, glass fill. Brand mark 30×30 radius 9 on `brand` with `on-brand` glyph. Nav item 34px tall, radius 10, padding 9; selected = `accent/selected` fill + `accent/selected-border` stroke + `accent/text` glyph; counts in `text/tertiary`.\n- **Live card** — `surface` + `border` stroke, radius 10, padding 11. Status dot `success`, label `text/primary`, broker `text/secondary`, full-width `accent` button.\n- **Buttons** — 28px tall, pill radius 14, horizontal padding 10–11, icon + label gap 5. Primary = `accent` bg + `on-accent`. Secondary = `surface/control`. Destructive = `danger/soft` bg + `danger` label.\n- **Inputs** — 28px tall, radius 7, `surface/control` fill, `border` stroke. Settings column uses a single 200px width for every control so the right edge reads as one column.\n- **Switch** — 34 × 20, radius 10. On: `accent` track. Off: `border` track.\n- **Icon badge** — 22 × 22 (24 in entity rows), radius 7, soft status tint with a matching saturated icon.\n- **Progress** — 4px (playback) or 6px (publish), radius 2–3, `accent` fill, `border` track.\n- **Cards** — radius 16, `surface` fill, shadow `rgba(0,0,0,0.05)` y1 blur3 (dark 0.25). Groups of rows use a 1px `border` background with 1px gaps instead of dividers.\n- **Media transport** — 30px circles, gap 4. Previous/next are ghost; play/pause is filled with `ink` and an `on-accent` glyph.\n- **Bridge diagram** — three 96px columns (Mac · MQTT · Home Assistant) joined by `border` rules and `icon/muted` arrows; each column is a soft status badge over a 11px label.\n\n## 5. Rules\n\n1. No raw hex in a component: use a token. New colors need a token first.\n2. Dark mode mirrors light mode role-for-role; do not invent one-off dark values.\n3. One type scale (8 steps), one radius scale, one spacing ramp.\n4. Every state a control can be in — on, off, selected, disabled, destructive — gets an explicit token, not a hardcoded variant.\n",
    "projectName": "Mac2MQTT — Design System",
    "typography": {
      "scale": "Inter for UI, Menlo for topics and other literals. Line height 1.1 for headings, 1.2 for body, 1.4 for prose.\n\n| Size | Weight | Use |\n|---|---|---|\n| 24 | 700 | hero app name (About) |\n| 20 | 700 | page title |\n| 16 | 600 | tile value |\n| 14 | 600 | card headline, track title |\n| 13 | 600 | metric value |\n| 12 | 600 | section label, nav label, row title, button label |\n| 11 | 400–600 | secondary text, tile label, badge label |\n| 10 | 400–600 | caption, entity count, hint, topic value |\n\nWeights: 400 body · 500 row title · 600 label & emphasis · 700 page title. Nothing below 10px; body copy never below 11px."
    },
    "componentStyles": "**Window** 820 × 660, corner radius 28, drop shadow `rgba(0,0,0,0.16)` y20 blur40 (dark: 0.45).\n**Grid** 196px sidebar + 16px gutter + 572px content column. Content padding: 50px top, 16px bottom.\n**Spacing** 2 / 4 / 6 / 8 / 10 / 12 / 14 / 16 — cards use 16, groups 12–14, list rows 13, tiles 14.\n**Radius scale** 4 artwork · 7 badge & input · 9 icon badge · 10 control & nav item · 14 tile, list, pill button · 15 circle · 16 card · 20 panel & app icon · 28 window.\n\n- **Sidebar** — 196px, radius 20, glass fill. Brand mark 30×30 radius 9 on `brand` with `on-brand` glyph. Nav item 34px tall, radius 10, padding 9; selected = `accent/selected` fill + `accent/selected-border` stroke + `accent/text` glyph; counts in `text/tertiary`.\n- **Live card** — `surface` + `border` stroke, radius 10, padding 11. Status dot `success`, label `text/primary`, broker `text/secondary`, full-width `accent` button.\n- **Buttons** — 28px tall, pill radius 14, horizontal padding 10–11, icon + label gap 5. Primary = `accent` bg + `on-accent`. Secondary = `surface/control`. Destructive = `danger/soft` bg + `danger` label.\n- **Inputs** — 28px tall, radius 7, `surface/control` fill, `border` stroke. Settings column uses a single 200px width for every control so the right edge reads as one column.\n- **Switch** — 34 × 20, radius 10. On: `accent` track. Off: `border` track.\n- **Icon badge** — 22 × 22 (24 in entity rows), radius 7, soft status tint with a matching saturated icon.\n- **Progress** — 4px (playback) or 6px (publish), radius 2–3, `accent` fill, `border` track.\n- **Cards** — radius 16, `surface` fill, shadow `rgba(0,0,0,0.05)` y1 blur3 (dark 0.25). Groups of rows use a 1px `border` background with 1px gaps instead of dividers.\n- **Media transport** — 30px circles, gap 4. Previous/next are ghost; play/pause is filled with `ink` and an `on-accent` glyph.\n- **Bridge diagram** — three 96px columns (Mac · MQTT · Home Assistant) joined by `border` rules and `icon/muted` arrows; each column is a soft status badge over a 11px label.\n\n1. No raw hex in a component: use a token. New colors need a token first.\n2. Dark mode mirrors light mode role-for-role; do not invent one-off dark values.\n3. One type scale (8 steps), one radius scale, one spacing ramp.\n4. Every state a control can be in — on, off, selected, disabled, destructive — gets an explicit token, not a hardcoded variant."
  },
